<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>!</p>

<p>Someone requested a link to change your Wine Words password. You can do this through the link below.</p>

<p><a href="<%= ENV.fetch('FRONTEND_URL', 'http://localhost:5173') %>/reset-password?reset_password_token=<%= @token %>">Change my password</a></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email. Your password won't change until you access the link above and create a new one.</p>
